{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
  "name": "connect-wallet",
  "type": "registry:block",
  "title": "Connect Wallet",
  "description": "A complete connect, identity, and disconnect surface wired to wagmi.",
  "docs": "```tsx\nimport { ConnectWallet } from \"@/components/ui/connect-wallet\"\n\n<ConnectWallet />\n```\n\nRequires a `WagmiProvider` and a TanStack `QueryClientProvider` above it. The component renders the connectors configured in wagmi. For mobile browsers, configure a remote connector such as wagmi's `metaMask()` or `walletConnect()`; `injected()` alone only works when the current browser exposes a wallet provider.",
  "dependencies": [
    "wagmi",
    "viem",
    "sonner",
    "lucide-react"
  ],
  "devDependencies": [],
  "registryDependencies": [
    "sonner",
    "tooltip",
    "dropdown-menu"
  ],
